==========================================================================
NOAA / NCEP NAM
==========================================================================

The port is written from the NAM source (github.com/MatthewPyle-NOAA/NAM @
83df4e13c115d197db67b972cb3befec8511291a, nam.v4.2.11). The NAM source is work of US Government
employees at NOAA/NCEP/EMC (and GFDL) and is distributed by NOAA without a licence file; it is
public domain in the US. Every file ported or copied from a NAM file keeps that file's NOAA
author/history header block, followed by a line naming the source path and lines.

No code from the NEMS framework, ESMF, nemsio, UPP, GSI or NCEPLIBS (LGPL and other terms) is
ported, copied, linked or called. NAM's phys/mersenne_twister.f (LGPL-2) is not copied: the McICA
kernels implement MT19937 from the published algorithm (Matsumoto and Nishimura 1998), and that
path is dormant in the NAM configuration (ISUBCLW = ISUBCSW = 0).

NOAA data used as model inputs (NOAA Open Data Dissemination) is used as distributed. It is not
permissible to state or imply endorsement by or affiliation with NOAA.

