==========================================================================
Data fetched at setup or run time (not in this repository)
==========================================================================

- NOAA fix files (CO2 history and monthly cycle, ozone climatology, solar constant, surface
  emissivity index), fetched by tools/fetch_fix.sh from the NOAA global fix bucket (fix/am).
  US Government data.
- Case inputs (NAM native analysis and boundary files, GFS 0.25 degree, MRMS), fetched from NOAA
  Open Data Dissemination by namgpu.init.init_fetch_case. US Government data.
- GMTED2010 terrain (USGS/NGA), read from the user's WPS geog set. Public domain.
- Climatological aerosol table parm/nam_climaeropac_global.txt: NCEP format of the OPAC
  climatology, Hess, Koepke and Schult (1998), Bull. Amer. Meteor. Soc. 79, 831-844, as
  redistributed by NOAA in the GFS fix set.
